# warnings

## INEFFECTIVE_DYNAMIC_IMPORT

```text
[INEFFECTIVE_DYNAMIC_IMPORT] array_one_arg/child.js is dynamically imported by array_one_arg/parent.js but also statically imported by array_one_arg/parent.js, dynamic import will not move module into another chunk.

```

